{"id":"434622","name":"酱肉绿豆汤","author":"我是狂草","authorId":"9407270","desc":"","cover":"images/434622/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"酱肉","amount":"400克"},{"name":"绿豆","amount":"200克"}],"sub":[{"name":"料酒","amount":"2茶匙"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"1/2茶匙"},{"name":"老姜","amount":"1块"},{"name":"小葱","amount":"1根"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"自制酱肉在清水中浸泡一夜；","img":"images/434622/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"冲洗干净，取部分切小方块。","img":"images/434622/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"绿豆泡发一夜，淘洗。","img":"images/434622/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"将绿豆沥水放入炖锅，下酱肉块、姜片、料酒；","img":"images/434622/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加足量清水；","img":"images/434622/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"大火烧沸、打尽浮沫，放胡椒粉，加盖、小火炖；","img":"images/434622/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"炖一个半小时左右，关火；","img":"images/434622/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"洒葱颗即可。","img":"images/434622/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：瓦煲\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}